        "exposedClass": "action-required",
        "statement": "The configuration setting `use_boltdb_shipper_as_backup` is no longer recognized; any explicit configuration will be ignored and the previous default value `false` will be applied.",
        "remediation": "Remove the `use_boltdb_shipper_as_backup` setting (and `-tsdb.shipper.use-boltdb-shipper-as-backup` CLI flag) from your Loki configuration, as the TSDB index is now the stable and recommended type.",
